WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
I made 1,000 during the day today

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,760
Now I have earned another 3800

3
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,240
That adds up to 4800

4
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,960
Plus there were about 300 left yesterday

5
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:08,080
So now I have 5,100 yuan in my hand, right?

6
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,040
Gotta buy a motorcycle

7
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:11,200
Now we have no war horses over there.

8
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,000
If a motorcycle becomes an iron horse

9
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,560
Just feed it with oil

10
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:17,200
Maybe we can form a motorcycle army in the future

11
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,560
Are you still afraid of their army in the building?

12
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:30,920
I don't know if I go back to sleep

13
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:48,790
I don’t know Brother Lu, the boy who got on the bus

14
00:00:48,790 --> 00:00:50,990
Here is our temporary collection of fitness equipment

15
00:00:51,070 --> 00:00:52,870
The eighth floor inside is our fitness club.

16
00:00:52,870 --> 00:00:54,630
You called me over and told me what to do

17
00:00:54,630 --> 00:01:00,110
You know our bodybuilding moves, but I don’t understand. Then what do you know? I know how to shoot and shoot.
